ur images next?":["Chce\u0161 teraz optimalizova\u0165 svoje obr\u00e1zky?"],"Imagify is ready now. Want me to optimize the images already on your site?":["Imagify je pripraven\u00e9. Chce\u0161, aby som optimalizoval obr\u00e1zky, ktor\u00e9 u\u017e na tvojom webe s\u00fa?"],"Optimize my images":["Optimalizova\u0165 moje obr\u00e1zky"],"Optimize images":["Optimalizova\u0165 obr\u00e1zky"],"Add API key":["Prida\u0165 API k\u013e\u00fa\u010d"],"Do you want to add your Imagify API key next?":["Chce\u0161 teraz prida\u0165 svoj API k\u013e\u00fa\u010d Imagify?"],"See plans":["Zobrazi\u0165 pl\u00e1ny"],"Do you want to see Imagify\u2019s plans?":["Chce\u0161 si pozrie\u0165 pl\u00e1ny Imagify?"]}}}